      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Counsel for Applicant :- Chandra Bhanu Singh Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A.,Manish Soni,Vyas Narayan Shukla Hon'ble Subhash Vidyarthi,J.\nHeard Sri Chandra Bhanu Singh, the learned counsel for the applicant, Sri Jayant Singh Tomar, the learned A.G.A.-I for the State amd Sri Prakhar Mishra holding brief of Sri Vyas Narayan Shukla,\nthelearned counsel for the informant and perused the record.",
