    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The instant application has been filed seeking bail for the applicant in Case Crime no. 308 of 2022,\nunder Section 363, 366, 376 I.P.C. and Section 3/4 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, registered at Police Station Gauriganj, District Amethi.",
